    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54dd3ba52cf8c7fd3bd05c4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东商变革说自己有两个目标──\n一个是找到“赛跑魔法”，\n另一个是成为跟祖母一样伟大的魔女。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b09f9eb8790591fe1425dc7e36e75e13ba16deacd122ca555e7901a0f074dab8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
